          "from": "Sanskrit daṇḍa [d̪əɳɖə] 'punishment, penalty'",
          "to": "denda /dənˈda/ 'fine, penalty'",
          "note": "Loanword adaptation; Malay has no retroflex stops."
        }
      ]
    }
